<title>UK: BOC slips on profit-taking.</title>
<headline>BOC slips on profit-taking.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in BOC Plc slipped on profit-taking after their recent rally, dealers said.</p>
<p>By 1322 GMT, the shares were off 12-1/2p to 922-1/2.</p>
<p>Shares in the UK chemicals concern jumped sharply earlier this month, with gains most recently fueled by an upbeat forecast from the company.</p>
<p>BOC said it expected 1997 to be a year of solid underlying progress at its January 17 annual meeting.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 542 4026</p>
</text>
